       Table layout: R0,G0,B0, R1,G1,B1, ...
       At INT16 offset of R: 32-bit load gives G(high16)|R(low16)
       At INT16 offset of B: 32-bit load gives next_R(high16)|B(low16)
       So for each corner, we need 2 gathers instead of 3. */

